# Project Rules: brain

## Auto-attach
- Python files (*.py) and Markdown files (*.md)

## Project Type
- Personal knowledge management system using imdone for task tracking

## Languages
- Python 3 (with requirements.txt for dependencies)
- Markdown for content and task management

## Structure
- `.imdone/` - Configuration for the imdone kanban board
- `journal/` - Personal journal entries
- `reference/` - Reference materials
- `backlog/` - Task backlog
- `scripts/` - Utility scripts
- `archive/` - Archived content

## Task Management
- Uses imdone kanban with custom lists (BACKLOG, PLANNING, TODO, DOING, DONE, etc.)
- Tasks are managed as cards with metadata (tags, due dates, reminders)

## URL Processing
- Contains Python scripts for processing and annotating URLs
- Uses API keys stored securely (likely for AI processing)

## Python Style
- Uses type hints
- Follows modern Python practices (pathlib, typing)
- Includes error handling and retries for API calls

## Documentation
- Markdown-based documentation
- Comments in code for complex logic

## Security
- API keys loaded from environment variables
- Credentials directory for secure storage
